category: Libs
build-depends: cygport bc gettext-devel gobject-introspection libarchive-devel libcairo-devel libcfitsio-devel libcgif-devel libexif-devel libexpat-devel libfftw3-devel libfontconfig-devel libglib2.0-devel libheif-devel libhwy-devel libimagequant-devel libintl-devel libjpeg-devel libjxl-devel liblcms2-devel libMagick-devel libmatio-devel libnifti-devel libopenexr-devel libopenjp2-devel libopenslide-devel libpango1.0-devel libpng-devel libpoppler-glib-devel libraw-devel librsvg2-devel libtiff-devel libuhdr-devel libwebp-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Fast image processing library with low memory needs (utilities)"
ldesc: "VIPS is a free image processing system. It is good with large images (images
larger than the amount of RAM you have available), with many CPUs (see
Benchmarks for examples of SMP scaling, VIPS is also part of the PARSEC
suite), for working with colour, for scientific analysis and for general
research & development. As well as JPEG, TIFF and PNG images, it also supports
scientific formats like FITS, Matlab, Analyze, PFM, Radiance and OpenSlide."
